div><div><h3>Building with Rails 8: Lightning Talks</h3><div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"> <path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path> <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle>\n</svg><p><span>Thursday, Apr 10 at 6:30 PM</span></p></div><p><span>·</span></p></div></div></article><!--── Simple activity (member joined) ──--><article><div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://radius.to/assets/home/demo_avatars/pink-6c9ec7dba00c7193594fe5fe05800ad4e546ab9c2f4db68068056703b6eed124.svg\"></p><div><p><span>Priya M.</span> joined&nbsp;<span>Oxford Cycling Club</span></p></div></div></article></div></section><!--── Post Form ──--><div data-nosnippet=\"\"><!--Left column: Post form (on desktop stays left)--><div><div><h3>Post what you're up for</h3><p>Takes 30 seconds. No commitment required.</p></div><div><p><label>What best describes you?</label></p><div><p>✓ Doing this soon — others welcome</p><p>Open to meeting others interested in this</p></div></div><p><a href=\"https://radius.to/activities/new\"><span>Post an activity</span></a></p></div><!--Right column: Text + \"What others see\" card together--><div><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"> <path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path> <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n</svg><p><span>Hyper-local discovery</span><span>BETA</span></p></div><h2>Meet others through interests.</h2><p>Coffee, a run, a bike ride: post it with a time and place. People nearby who share that interest can join you.</p><!--Arrow + sample result--><p><span>What others see</span></p><div><p><img alt=\"Sarah K.\" loading=\"laz